# Pixelcut: AI Photo Editor

> Pixelcut empowers creators, e-commerce sellers, marketers, and small businesses to craft professional-grade visuals in seconds with an AI-first image-editing suite. Core image editing tool offerings include Background Remover, Image Upscaler, Magic Eraser, AI Image Generator, AI Video Generator, and other AI-driven image editing and generative tools, easy for anyone to use. Pixelcut also provides a suite of developer-friendly APIs, making it easy to integrate powerful AI image editing tools into apps, products, and automated workflows.


